与审美态度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/aesthetic-experience/disinterestedness-and-attitude"},{"seq":3,"slug":"the-sublime","title":"崇高：审美经验的深邃一面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/aesthetic-experience/the-sublime"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"judgment-and-significance","title":"审美判断与意义","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/judgment-and-significance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"paradox-of-taste","title":"趣味的吊诡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/judgment-and-significance/paradox-of-taste"},{"seq":2,"slug":"standard-of-taste","title":"趣味的标准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/judgment-and-significance/standard-of-taste"},{"seq":3,"slug":"art-value","title":"艺术的价值：我们为何需要艺术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/judgment-and-significance/art-value"},{"seq":4,"slug":"contemporary-and-significance","title":"当代议题与美学的意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/aesthetics/judgment-and-significance/contemporary-and-significance"}]}]}